<title>POLAND: Jelfa surges on strong December earnings.</title>
<headline>Jelfa surges on strong December earnings.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish drug maker Jelfa SA rose 9.5 percent to 63.5 zlotys after recording a 0.8 million zloty profit in December compared to a loss in the same month a year ago, analysts said.</p>
<p>&quot;The profit following last year's loss certainly must have helped,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Analysts also said drug makers on several markets were enjoying popularity. Last week Jelfa and Polfa Kutno, which fell 0.8 percent on Monday to 121 zlotys, rose 13.7 percent and 16.7 percent respectively.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
